    "text": "Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>256</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>Hz</mi><mo>;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#965;</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>345</mn><mo>.6</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#955;</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#965;</mi><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>345.6</mn><mn>256</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.35</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />In one cycle, sound advances by distance <math> <mi>&#955;</mi> </math><br /><br />Therefore, the required distance travelled by sound,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>60.</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#955;</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>"
